# Byte-exact repository. Do not change this without understanding why it exists.
#
# This record publishes sha256 digests of files stored here. Any end-of-line
# conversion changes those bytes and therefore breaks every published digest --
# silently, and only for people who clone rather than for whoever committed.
# `-text` disables all EOL translation so a clone on any platform reproduces
# the exact bytes the digests were computed over.
* -text
